# --- Benchmark data: keep local, do not commit -------------------------------
# The CantoNLU data is CC BY 4.0 (confirmed by the authors); we keep it local so that
# everyone downloads the same version from the source. See data/README.md.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/.gitkeep
canto-nlu/

# --- Local working notes: not part of submitted repository ------------------
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
docs/

